        </div>
        <div class="frame">
          <div class="plotzone" id="plot-atm" set:html={CH.atm()} />
          <div class="plotfoot">
            <span class="src">Source: NPCI, NFS daily statistics.</span>
            <span class="dl"><button data-dl="svg">SVG</button><button data-dl="png">PNG</button><button data-dl="csv">CSV</button><a href={SRC_ECO} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Source</a></span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="explain">
          <div class="ev">
            <span class="mk">How to read this</span>
            <p>NFS carries a transaction when a card from one bank is used at another bank's ATM, so this is not every ATM withdrawal: using your own bank's ATM does not cross NPCI. It also counts balance enquiries and other non-cash uses. The RBI's payments guide has all ATM cash withdrawals, monthly.</p>
          </div>
