            <span class="mk">As of {U.nfs.lastDay}</span>
            <p>NFS carried <b id="ex-at-last" set:html={N["ex-at-last"]}></b> transactions on the latest day in NPCI's table, against <b id="ex-at-first" set:html={N["ex-at-first"]}></b> on {U.nfs.firstDay}.</p>
