      </figure>
    </div>
    <div class="break">
      <figure id="cb-bhim" style="margin:0">
        <div class="plate-head">
          <div class="t">
            <h3 id="h-bhim" set:html={N["h-bhim"]}></h3>
            <div class="sub">BHIM's payments as a share of all UPI payments, per cent. NPCI changed what it counts in April 2020, from payments started in BHIM to payments where BHIM was the payer's app; the two are drawn apart.</div>
          </div>
