          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="explain">
          <div class="ev">
            <span class="mk">How to read this</span>
            <p>BHIM, launched by NPCI weeks after the 2016 note withdrawal, was the first app many people used for UPI. Its share fell as private apps grew. The pale line counts payments started in BHIM, the dark one payments where BHIM was the payer's app; they are different counts and are not joined.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="now">
            <span class="mk">As of {MB}</span>
            <p>BHIM carried <b id="ex-bh-n" set:html={N["ex-bh-n"]}></b> payments, <b id="ex-bh-s" set:html={N["ex-bh-s"]}></b> of UPI, against <b id="ex-bh-s0" set:html={N["ex-bh-s0"]}></b> in {U.bhim.firstMonth} under the present count.</p>
