            <span class="mk">How to read this</span>
            <p>An e-RUPI voucher is paid for by a government or company and can be spent only on what it was issued for, such as a lab test, a seed purchase or a scooter subsidy, by showing a QR code or SMS. Until December 2023 NPCI listed vouchers by scheme; since then by the bank that issued them, so the two halves of the line count the same thing under different breakdowns.</p>
